WEBVTT

00:25:59.596 --> 00:26:01.116
Families can model,

00:26:01.116 --> 00:26:03.116
parents can model for kids.

00:26:03.156 --> 00:26:04.876
We can have disagreements.

00:26:04.916 --> 00:26:10.236
We can work it out and and hold on
to these good relationships

00:26:10.276 --> 00:26:11.916
even through disagreements.

00:26:11.956 --> 00:26:16.116
Those are some of the biggest lessons
we can help our children with,

00:26:16.156 --> 00:26:18.036
about how to use their feelings

00:26:18.036 --> 00:26:20.916
rather than kind of,
be buffeted by their feelings

00:26:20.916 --> 00:26:22.916
and ruled by their feelings.

00:26:22.916 --> 00:26:26.676
WPR: I'm curious just where you see
the study going from here.

00:26:27.116 --> 00:26:30.956
RW: We are collecting more data,
even as we speak.